<item><title>AU calls for Sudanese-led talks after Ethiopia proposes dialogue</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/au-calls-for-sudanese-led-talks-after-ethiopia-proposes-9236b5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/au-calls-for-sudanese-led-talks-after-ethiopia-proposes-9236b5/</guid><category>Ethiopia</category><description>African Union Commission Chairperson Mahmoud Ali Youssouf said Sudanese stakeholders should lead any talks to end the war after Ethiopia offered to convene them.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:45:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" length="32890" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sudan plans to mobilise 6,000 fighters on Ethiopian border</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/sudan-plans-to-mobilise-6-000-fighters-on-ethiopian-border-00de4e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/sudan-plans-to-mobilise-6-000-fighters-on-ethiopian-border-00de4e/</guid><category>Ethiopia</category><description>A Sudanese Special Forces official announced the plan in Gedaref State, accusing Ethiopia of assembling troops near the frontier.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:35:23 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" length="32890" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ethiopia&apos;s EIH gives China’s TW Holding 51% of textbook venture</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-s-eih-gives-china-s-tw-holding-51-of-textbook-8f15fa/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-s-eih-gives-china-s-tw-holding-51-of-textbook-8f15fa/</guid><category>Ethiopia</category><description>The proposed $30 million first phase would print, bind, package and distribute school textbooks and teachers’ guides in Ethiopia.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:11:44 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" length="32890" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ethiopia offers bondholders $880 million in new debt for $1 billion</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-offers-bondholders-880-million-in-new-debt-for-1-8f5e11/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-offers-bondholders-880-million-in-new-debt-for-1-8f5e11/</guid><category>Ethiopia</category><description>The exchange cuts principal by 12%, pays missed interest and offers investors a $5 fee for valid instructions before December 11.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:50:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-offers-bondholders-880-million-in-new-debt-for-1-8f5e11/share.jpg" length="44095" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-offers-bondholders-880-million-in-new-debt-for-1-8f5e11/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ethiopian regional forces clash near Kenya as 50,000 cross into Moyale</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopian-regional-forces-clash-near-kenya-as-50-000-cross-0e0ab2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopian-regional-forces-clash-near-kenya-as-50-000-cross-0e0ab2/</guid><category>Ethiopia</category><description>Kenyan officials are preparing for as many as 80,000 arrivals after fighting between Oromia and Somali regional forces spilled across the border.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:27:49 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" length="32890" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
